  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Myanmar Humanitarian Package Extension 2023-25</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This humanitarian investment will help meet the needs of people affected by conflict and instability in Myanmar. Objectives are: 1. Basic needs: Affected communities in Myanmar and along its borders have safer and more equitable access to protection and humanitarian assistance 2. Self-reliance: Affected communities are more self-reliant and better prepared for voluntary return, as appropriate 3. Resilience: Communities are better prepared to prevent, prepare for and respond to crises and disasters in Myanmar 4. Reform: Humanitarian system better meets the needs of the affected population. This complements an investment in Bangladesh.</narrative>
  </description>
